{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"schrödingers dumbass","id":"264570136025890816","is_bot":0,"username":"greylikessharks"},"author_id":"264570136025890816","channel_id":"739055666651463691","content":"“I don’t know about that, but I’m the “general” on the council now. I want us to have a plan as an entire town. I just fear people won’t listen, or agree, because the Knights and Masons have differing plans on how to kill it.”","created_at":"2020-08-19T16:59:22.733000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745688374635004055","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
